# OpenScreen reads the credential for whichever provider is selected as
# agent.provider in config.json, using pi's credential names. The same
# provider and model serve both the interactive Agent and background Memory.
# The checked-in default is minimax-cn; uncomment the line matching your own
# config.json selection instead. Multiple providers' credentials can be set
# at once with no conflict — only the one matching the active provider is read.
MINIMAX_CN_API_KEY=your-api-key
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-api-key
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-api-key
